# playpick cell: mode=walk boss=gorged spec=mage:frost style=dodge size=25
# difficulty=heroic view=844x390,touch save=carried.
#
# save=carried behaves as fresh here -- confirmed again this session
# (2026-10-01-15-probe.play): this profile's RAID setup screen showed 10/
# Normal, "1 of 11 built rooms open here", the untouched default, which is
# exactly #273's open finding (playbot's PID-derived port gives every
# invocation a fresh localStorage origin, so --profile never actually
# carries anything between separate playbot runs). So this follows the same
# driver-lesson recipe every other 25-heroic walk/clear cell in this ledger
# has used since 2026-09-26: `open #b=marrow&s=25&h=1` to unlock the rung,
# then back out to a real front-door RAID -> WALK IN, confirmed working a
# second time in 2026-10-01-16-probe.play (raid-setup-after-unlock.png shows
# 25/Heroic, both 2/2).
#
# "walk" aims at a named boss rather than going as far as possible (that is
# `clear`). gorged (The Bloodgorged) is `rise`, the fourth real fight up the
# lower spire -- encounters.ts/dungeon.ts: spire=marrow(0), oratory=whisper(1),
# mooring=an eleventh fight appended out of list order (encounter:10), then
# rise=gorged(3). So the room order from the threshold is: threshold -> vigil
# (trash corridor) -> spire(marrow) -> climb -> oratory(whisper) -> mooring
# (11th boss) -> rise(gorged). Budgeting one evening-step per room plus the
# corridor hops, with room enough left over to actually fight gorged once
# reached.
#
# No `mage:frost`+`dodge` evening/walk reading exists yet (checked
# sessions.jsonl: every prior dodge evening was warrior/paladin/druid/hunter
# tank-or-dps-melee-or-ranged-physical; frost mage is the first pure caster
# under dodge in mode=walk/clear), and direction.md's #6 (the Vigil stalling
# near y=-1560..-1573) and #3 (PULL AGAIN never reviving after a travel wipe)
# are both already confirmed on several specs/styles -- watching for either,
# not re-filing if seen again.
open #b=marrow&s=25&h=1
tap back
tap raid
shot raid-setup
tap next
tap class:mage:frost
shot class-selected
tap pull
waitscreen fight 15
state
shot start
targets
ui
evening dodge 130 8
shot end
state
says
bill
